PHP and compiled JavaScript for Borealis: Arctic Expeditions.

- php/Game.php — server game class and board-state helpers
- php/States/ — turn state classes (opening mulligan, gameplay, regroup, replenish, objectives)
- js/Game.js — client interface compiled from src/ts (edit TypeScript, not this file)

See https://en.doc.boardgamearena.com/Studio_file_reference#modules.2F
